<title>USA: Tele Danmark says not picked by Austria co.</title>
<headline>Tele Danmark says not picked by Austria co.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tele Danmark said Wednesday its bid to become a partner with a subsdiary of the Austrian company PTA was not accepted.</p>
<p>The company said it was making a bid to become a partner with Mobilkom, a subsidiary of PTA.</p>
<p>The company said PTA evaluating offers from a number of companies.</p>
<p>No further information was immediately available.</p>
</text>
